{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-article","blocks":{"featured_image":{"type":"featured_image","disabled":true,"settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"image_height":"medium","image_ratio":"4x3"}},"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"heading_size":"h2"}},"content":{"type":"content","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20}}},"block_order":["featured_image","heading","content"],"settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":0,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":20,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"column_width":12,"content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left"}},"image_DpTC3N":{"type":"image","blocks":{"image_piMpmT":{"type":"image","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"image":"{{ article.image }}","image_ratio":"4x5"}}},"block_order":["image_piMpmT"],"name":"t:image.presets.image.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":0,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":0,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","media_contain_width":true,"column_width":12,"content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center"}},"rich_text_pGd3yD":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_N8rpcr":{"type":"heading","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"heading":"Mix High and Low","heading_size":"h3","convert_to_h1":false}},"paragraph_haAeiX":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"text":"<p>One of the hallmarks of street style is the art of mixing high-end pieces with more affordable finds. Pair a designer statement piece, such as a luxe leather jacket or designer sneakers, with everyday basics like denim jeans or a plain white tee. This juxtaposition of luxury and accessibility creates a dynamic and interesting look that's effortlessly cool.<\/p><h3>Play with Proportions<\/h3><p>Experiment with proportions to add visual interest to your outfit. Try pairing oversized pieces with more fitted items, such as a slouchy sweater with skinny jeans or a billowy blouse with tailored trousers. Mixing different silhouettes creates a sense of balance and adds a fashion-forward edge to your street style ensemble.<\/p><h3>Accessorize with Attitude<\/h3><p>Accessories are the finishing touches that elevate your street style look from ordinary to extraordinary. Experiment with statement accessories like bold sunglasses, chunky jewelry, or a statement handbag to add personality and flair to your outfit. Don't be afraid to mix and match textures, colors, and patterns to create a visually striking ensemble.<\/p><h3>Embrace Sneaker Culture<\/h3><p>Sneakers are a staple of street style fashion, offering both comfort and style in equal measure. Whether you prefer classic white kicks, retro-inspired high-tops, or avant-garde designer sneakers, there's a pair out there to suit every taste and aesthetic. Elevate your street style look by pairing sneakers with unexpected pieces, such as a tailored suit or a flowy maxi dress.<\/p>","text_column":"","grid_gap_desktop":20,"text_size":"body-fs-md"}}},"block_order":["heading_N8rpcr","paragraph_haAeiX"],"name":"t:rich_text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_bg_repeat":false,"section_bg_position":"bottom center","section_bg_size":"auto","section_bg_opacity":100,"column_width":10,"content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","title_position":"inline","grid_gap_desktop":20}},"multicolumn_DAyJVW":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_8xpHaD":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>Street style isn’t just what you wear—it’s how you wear your confidence.<\/p>","image":"","btn_label":"","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line"}},"column_k4ykTT":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>Mix, match, and break the rules; true style is fearless and unapologetic.<\/p>","image":"","btn_label":"","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line"}}},"block_order":["column_8xpHaD","column_k4ykTT"],"name":"t:multicolumn.presets.multicolumn.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_width":"constrict","columns_alignment":"left","image_ratio":"4x5","content_width":12,"content_position":"left","content_alignment":"left","columns_desktop":2,"columns_mobile":"2","column_gap_desktop":20,"row_gap_desktop":20,"column_gap_mobile":20,"row_gap_mobile":20,"heading":"","heading_size":"h2","text":"","text_size":"body-fs-sm","btn_label":"Discover more","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line","btn_icon":false}},"quote_GaRXjc":{"type":"quote","blocks":{"heading_PRCAqR":{"type":"heading","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"heading":"The season isn’t defined by what you wear, but by how effortlessly you shine in it.","heading_size":"h2"}}},"block_order":["heading_PRCAqR"],"name":"t:quote.presets.quote.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_bg_repeat":false,"section_bg_position":"bottom center","section_bg_size":"auto","section_bg_opacity":100,"column_width":10,"content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left"}},"rich_text_JBGhEX":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_AnpggR":{"type":"heading","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"heading":"","heading_size":"h3","convert_to_h1":false}},"paragraph_GbTEX9":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"text":"<h3>Experiment with Layers<\/h3><p>Layering is key to mastering the art of street style, allowing you to create depth and dimension in your outfit. Play with different textures and lengths, such as layering a denim jacket over a hoodie or a cropped sweater over a button-down shirt. This adds visual interest to your look while also providing practicality for changing weather conditions.<\/p><h3>Make a Statement with Prints<\/h3><p>Prints are a fun and playful way to inject personality into your street style look. Experiment with bold prints like animal print, florals, or graphic patterns to add visual interest and intrigue to your outfit. Mix and match prints for a fashion-forward look, or keep it simple by incorporating one statement print into your ensemble.<\/p>","text_column":"","grid_gap_desktop":20,"text_size":"body-fs-md"}}},"block_order":["heading_AnpggR","paragraph_GbTEX9"],"name":"t:rich_text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_bg_repeat":false,"section_bg_position":"bottom center","section_bg_size":"auto","section_bg_opacity":100,"column_width":10,"content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","title_position":"inline","grid_gap_desktop":20}},"multicolumn_gmHrPG":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_Ln3VNf":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"","image":"","btn_label":"","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line"}},"column_XLmGzC":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"","image":"","btn_label":"","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line"}}},"block_order":["column_Ln3VNf","column_XLmGzC"],"name":"t:multicolumn.presets.multicolumn.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_width":"constrict","columns_alignment":"left","image_ratio":"4x5","content_width":12,"content_position":"left","content_alignment":"left","columns_desktop":2,"columns_mobile":"2","column_gap_desktop":20,"row_gap_desktop":20,"column_gap_mobile":20,"row_gap_mobile":20,"heading":"","heading_size":"h2","text":"","text_size":"body-fs-sm","btn_label":"Discover more","btn_url":"","btn_style":"line","btn_icon":false}},"rich_text_iPE4e8":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_wjhHah":{"type":"heading","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"heading":"Express yourself","heading_size":"h2","convert_to_h1":false}},"paragraph_wQTLL7":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"block_spacing_top_desktop":20,"block_spacing_bottom_desktop":20,"block_spacing_top_mobile":20,"block_spacing_bottom_mobile":20,"text":"<p>This season unfolds like a series of still frames—moments suspended between intention and instinct. The silhouettes sharpen, then dissolve; fabrics whisper against the skin, moving with the weightlessness of a passing thought. The collection is an ode to restraint, but not silence—each piece carries its own quiet defiance.<\/p><p>Matte leather brushed with a soft grain. Wool that holds its structure but never its rigidity. Silk with the faintest sheen, catching only what the daylight offers. Every fabric chosen not just for its look, but for the stories it holds when it moves.<\/p>","text_column":"","grid_gap_desktop":100,"text_size":"body-fs-md"}}},"block_order":["heading_wjhHah","paragraph_wQTLL7"],"name":"t:rich_text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"section_id":"","section_padding_top_desktop":80,"section_padding_bottom_desktop":80,"section_padding_top_mobile":40,"section_padding_bottom_mobile":40,"invert_navigation_color":false,"color_scheme":"","section_bg_repeat":false,"section_bg_position":"bottom center","section_bg_size":"auto","section_bg_opacity":100,"column_width":12,"content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","title_position":"left","grid_gap_desktop":60}}},"order":["main","image_DpTC3N","rich_text_pGd3yD","multicolumn_DAyJVW","quote_GaRXjc","rich_text_JBGhEX","multicolumn_gmHrPG","rich_text_iPE4e8"]}